request.description:
llama.cpp-native completion. Distinct from `/v1/completions`: exposes llama.cpp-specific sampler knobs (`n_predict`, `mirostat`, `top_k`, `min_p`, `repeat_penalty`, `grammar`, `json_schema`, `cache_prompt`, `slot_id`, ...) that the OpenAI-shaped endpoints don't. Response shape: `{content, tokens_predicted, tokens_evaluated, timings, stop, ...}`. Add `"stream": true` for NDJSON streaming (one `{content, stop}` object per line).

#### Schemas

llama.cpp's native completion: no chat template, llama.cpp's own sampler knobs. With `"stream": true` the body is `text/event-stream` (server-sent events, not NDJSON): each `data:` line is this object holding only `content`, `tokens`, `stop: false` and the counters, until a last one with `stop: true` and the rest.

Request body (`application/json`):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "$comment": "README § POST /completion options; a subset",
  "required": ["prompt"],
  "properties": {
    "prompt": {
      "anyOf": [
        {"type": "string"},
        {"type": "array"},
        {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true}
      ],
      "description": "A string, token ids, a mix, or `{prompt_string, multimodal_data}`; a list of prompts answers a list"
    },
    "n_predict": {"type": "integer", "description": "Tokens to generate; -1: no limit"},
    "temperature": {"type": "number"},
    "top_k": {"type": "integer"},
    "top_p": {"type": "number"},
    "min_p": {"type": "number"},
    "stop": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {"type": "string"},
      "description": "Stop strings, not included in `content`"
    },
    "stream": {"type": "boolean"},
    "cache_prompt": {"type": "boolean", "default": true},
    "grammar": {"type": "string"},
    "json_schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true},
    "n_probs": {"type": "integer"},
    "id_slot": {"type": "integer"}
  }
}
```

Response `200` (`application/json`):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": ["content", "stop"],
  "properties": {
    "content": {"type": "string", "description": "The completion (a stream: the next piece)"},
