```

llama.cpp-native tokenizer. Returns `{"tokens": [int, int, ...]}` — the model's tokenization of `content`. Pass `"add_special": true` to include BOS/EOS markers, `"with_pieces": true` to also get the string piece for each token id. Useful for context-window budgeting before firing a large completion at a 65 k-context server (see `-c 65536` in the compose command).

#### Schemas

Request body (`application/json`):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": ["content"],
  "properties": {
    "content": {"type": "string"},
    "add_special": {"type": "boolean", "default": false, "description": "Insert BOS"},
    "parse_special": {"type": "boolean", "default": true},
    "with_pieces": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false,
      "description": "Return `{id, piece}` objects instead of bare ids"
    }
  }
}
```

Response `200` (`application/json`):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": ["tokens"],
  "properties": {
    "tokens": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "anyOf": [
          {"type": "integer"},
          {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "required": ["id", "piece"],
            "properties": {
              "id": {"type": "integer"},
              "piece": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {"type": "string"},
                  {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {"type": "integer"}
                  }
                ],
                "description": "A string, or its bytes when not valid UTF-8"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Ids, or `{id, piece}` with `with_pieces`"
    }
  }
}
```

llama.cpp-native detokenizer. Returns `{"content": "..."}` — the string reconstructed from the token id array. Inverse of `/tokenize`. Handy when consuming logprobs or streaming diagnostics that surface raw token ids.

#### Schemas

Request body (`application/json`):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": ["tokens"],
  "properties": {
    "tokens": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {"type": "integer"}
    }
  }
}
```

Response `200` (`application/json`):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": ["content"],
  "properties": {
    "content": {"type": "string"}
  }
}
```

